OL,3,GNEWSALabour wins Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aby-election, beating Green leader Zack
OL,5,APolanski
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour has won the Holborn and St
OL,8,FPancras by-election, with Camden
OL,9,FCouncil leader Sagal Abdi-Wali
OL,10,Freceiving 12,292 votes
OL,12,FGreen leader Zack Polanski came in
OL,13,Fsecond, with the party conceding defeat
OL,14,Fshortly before the result was announced
OL,16,FThe north London seat became vacant
OL,17,Fafter former Prime Minister Keir
OL,18,FStarmer announced he was standing down
OL,19,Ffrom the House of Commons last month
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
